                        <a name="shipping1">How do I recieve my items?</a><!--End-->
                        <h1>Shipping</h1>
                        <p>Orders for packaged products that are not elastic can be filled through traditional shipping channels.</p>
                        <p>
                            Products ordered through the platform from vendors can come from the vendor directly or by member drive.
                        </p>
                        <p>For our grower members who purchase products from growers who produce products with a greater shelf life will be made available to you automatically on the market page without restrictions.</p>

